    "Sign resolved from code: remaining = (due − received) summed over 비과세+과세; remaining < 0 → 과수납, else 손비처리 → 손비, else remaining > 0 → 미수, remaining == 0 → no status. desk.md's wording 'received − due negative → 과수납' is inverted; the redesign's `due − received > 0 → OUTSTANDING` matches the code.",
